+
+Expected result:
+
+- `result_kind` is `result_set`.
+- `statement_class` is `query`.
+- The payload contains `columns`, `rows`, or `row_objects`.
+
+## Close the session
+
+```bash
+curl -sS -D - -o /dev/null \
+  -X DELETE http://127.0.0.1:18088/mcp \
+  -H "MCP-Session-Id: ${SESSION_ID}" \
